      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `isRadiusIncreasing` were a float holding `sign(1 - f)` instead of a bool holding `(1 - f) \u003e 0`, then this code could be:\n\n            t \u003d (isRadiusIncreasing * x_t);\n            if (isNativelyFocal) {\n                t +\u003d f;\n            }\n            \n(Assuming the radius \u003d\u003d 0 case isn\u0027t an issue)",
